{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q418361","formula":"C₂₀H₂₃N","hill":"C20H23N","elements":["H","C","N"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":23.0,"N":1.0},"names":{"en":"Maprotiline","ru":"Мапротилин","uk":"Мапротилін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Maprotiline, sold under the brand name Ludiomil among others, is a tetracyclic antidepressant (TeCA) that is used in the treatment of depression. It may alternatively be classified as a tricyclic antidepressant (TCA), specifically a secondary amine. In terms of its chemistry and pharmacology, maprotiline is closely related to such-other secondary-amine TCAs as nortriptyline and protriptyline and has similar effects to them, albeit with more distinct anxiolytic effects.","ru":"Мапротилин (Maprotiline, торговое наименование: «Людиомил», 3-Метиламинопропил)дибензо-[b, e]-бицикло-[2,2,2]-октадиен) — лекарственное средство (антидепрессант).","uk":"Мапротилін (англ. Maprotiline, лат. Maprotilinum) — синтетичний лікарський засіб, що належить до групи чотирициклічних антидепресантів, що застосовується як перорально., так і внутрішньом'язово та внутрішньовенно."},"fame":29,"pubchemCid":4011,"mass":277.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CNCCCC12CCC(C3=CC=CC=C31)C4=CC=CC=C24","inchikey":"QSLMDECMDJKHMQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"N-methyl-3-(1-tetracyclo[6.6.2.02,7.09,14]hexadeca-2,4,6,9,11,13-hexaenyl)propan-1-amine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"4011","atoms":44,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":5.104,"y":-0.522,"z":-0.322,"el":"N"},{"x":0.133,"y":-0.451,"z":-0.237,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.043,"y":0.747,"z":-1.16,"el":"C"},{"x":0.12,"y":-0.429,"z":-1.804,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.161,"y":0.277,"z":-2.341,"el":"C"},{"x":0.008,"y":1.025,"z":0.187,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.18,"y":-1.15,"z":0.166,"el":"C"},{"x":1.402,"y":-1.149,"z":0.261,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.163,"y":1.657,"z":-0.